  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Draw the floor plan of primary school consist of two classrooms, one teacher's room, one veranda and two toilets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) Calculate the illumination of the floor plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) Draw the electrical installation of this floor plan building according to calculated illumination."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) Draw the conduit run and electrical wiring diagrams for both light and power circuits according to the installation plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iv) Calculate the load and determine the conductor size."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(v) Finally estimate the quantity of conduit and wire of different sizes require for complete curing of this building."
    },
